# Files & Purpose

| File               | Tool Used | Why                     |
| ------------------ | --------- | ----------------------- |
| `Card.jsx`         | React     | Root container          |
| `CardHeader.jsx`   | React     | Header wrapper          |
| `CardContent.jsx`  | React     | Body/content wrapper    |
| `CardFooter.jsx`   | React     | Footer/action wrapper   |
| `Card.variants.js` | CVA       | Card variants & padding |
| `index.js`         | —         | Barrel export           |
